{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415045","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415045","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1041504501:1":{"text":"我已经很久没有见到过妖精了……上一次，是什么时候来着？","source_cn":"我已经很久没有见到过妖精了……上一次，是什么时候来着？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6454B7629D6A8C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041504502:1":{"text":"……是你特意起了个大早去摘花，给荆棘队长授职仪式做准备的时候哦！","source_cn":"……是你特意起了个大早去摘花，给荆棘队长授职仪式做准备...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA38C5C2042CD341F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041504503:1":{"text":"哦？哦……对。奇怪，你怎么知道？","source_cn":"哦？哦……对。奇怪，你怎么知道？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CC043625E5D61A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041504504:1":{"text":"这个嘛……嘻嘻！正式介绍一下，我是塔西，是一名梦守妖精，平时喜欢在梦境里待着。","source_cn":"这个嘛……嘻嘻！正式介绍一下，我是塔西，是一名梦守妖精...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80984394A8CCF7C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041504505:1":{"text":"说不准什么时候，我路过了你的梦境，所以我们认识的时候，比你想象得还要早呢。","source_cn":"说不准什么时候，我路过了你的梦境，所以我们认识的时候，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE83913F6B830E3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041504506:1":{"text":"啊……这样说起来，你不会感觉到孤单吗……？","source_cn":"啊……这样说起来，你不会感觉到孤单吗……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD61BF0C4691D6CCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041504507:1":{"text":"毕竟大多数人醒来就把梦忘得一干二净，只有你保留着在梦里的记忆。","source_cn":"毕竟大多数人醒来就把梦忘得一干二净，只有你保留着在梦里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA001E6E2D0ADA843","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041504508:1":{"text":"哇……你好温柔啊，果然像你的梦境一样，是个细腻体贴的人呢。","source_cn":"哇……你好温柔啊，果然像你的梦境一样，是个细腻体贴的人呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD43C5882751795F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041504509:1":{"text":"我记不清自己做过什么样的梦，你可以和我说说吗？","source_cn":"我记不清自己做过什么样的梦，你可以和我说说吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF264F53F4D60556","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041504510:1":{"text":"哎呀呀，又到我最喜欢的环节了！","source_cn":"哎呀呀，又到我最喜欢的环节了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B1869FA0EE2D479","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041504511:1":{"text":"用别人梦里精彩的经历来勾起他们的好奇心，再逐个揭露，等待他们的梦境掀起新一轮的变化……这游戏太有意思了！我永远也玩不腻！","source_cn":"用别人梦里精彩的经历来勾起他们的好奇心，再逐个揭露，等...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x594CCD565BAA8277","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041504512:1":{"text":"呵呵……听你说的，我都想亲自去我的梦里瞧瞧了。","source_cn":"呵呵……听你说的，我都想亲自去我的梦里瞧瞧了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACBFB98F15B04E97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041504513:1":{"text":"说到这里，我已经开始期待我们下一次梦中冒险了！","source_cn":"说到这里，我已经开始期待我们下一次梦中冒险了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5AA3A23E4F15595","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041504514:1":{"text":"那么，可以告诉我，我上一次的梦境是什么样的吗？","source_cn":"那么，可以告诉我，我上一次的梦境是什么样的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EA360B1DE3B7BF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041504515:1":{"text":"当然，我可以肯定地说……帕瑞莎，你的梦境远超过你的想象。","source_cn":"当然，我可以肯定地说……帕瑞莎，你的梦境远超过你的想象。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2D043BCE0DB3A59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041504516:1":{"text":"上次，我见到你挥动法杖击倒了黑金商会的人，还亲手净化了薄暮丛林里所有的腐化……","source_cn":"上次，我见到你挥动法杖击倒了黑金商会的人，还亲手净化了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x672F29B34334600F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041504517:1":{"text":"就连伊米尔那个家伙都跪在你脚下，高喊着“薄暮丛林的女王啊，从此我愿为您效劳”……","source_cn":"就连伊米尔那个家伙都跪在你脚下，高喊着“薄暮丛林的女王...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x482E531A97707FB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041504518:1":{"text":"……真、真的吗？！这是我梦里做出来的事？","source_cn":"……真、真的吗？！这是我梦里做出来的事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60BC8971F41E634E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041504519:1":{"text":"帕瑞莎，你的梦境远超过你的想象。这句话的意思是——你远比你想象中强大。","source_cn":"帕瑞莎，你的梦境远超过你的想象。这句话的意思是——你远...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28AA89CC32E42A6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1041504520:1":{"text":"是吗……明明现实里，我什么都不敢做，只敢浑浑噩噩地醉倒在花丛中……","source_cn":"是吗……明明现实里，我什么都不敢做，只敢浑浑噩噩地醉倒...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A0D38ECD7887242","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1041504521:1":{"text":"但你从来不缺乏抗争的勇气——这是梦境告诉我的。","source_cn":"但你从来不缺乏抗争的勇气——这是梦境告诉我的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E13445865D18A5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1041504522:1":{"text":"多谢……多谢你了，温柔的小家伙。","source_cn":"多谢……多谢你了，温柔的小家伙。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF514ADE3779BAEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1041504523:1":{"text":"我想你应该在我的梦境里看到了更多黑暗的东西，但你用聪明又温柔的讲述方式，成功地安慰了一位被自责困住的女士。","source_cn":"我想你应该在我的梦境里看到了更多黑暗的东西，但你用聪明...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23C7BFA837BCBEFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1041504524:1":{"text":"很高兴认识你，欢迎你再来我的梦境里玩。","source_cn":"很高兴认识你，欢迎你再来我的梦境里玩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7F1E1EA3C47FF50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:帕瑞莎":{"text":"帕瑞莎","source":"帕瑞莎","status":"source"},"speaker:塔西":{"text":"塔西","source":"塔西","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":25,"localized_text_count":24,"speaker_count":2}}